        "releaseOnly": "The bundle call adds draft admission, attachment and publication to the prepare stages; those stages are inventoried under native-release-bundle.yml and native-release-prepare.yml, where the prepare jobs have a pre-merge rehearsal and the publishing jobs carry their own entries."
      }
    },
