        "sha256": "26ab758ceea3dca7f8fdda9762eacec0ef8c89696ab8f046c00a942d6f57b931",
        "releaseOnly": "Live checks read the allocated draft, its merged-main commit, the PR check suite and published releases, and the hold marker is a write to the real draft. The same gates run before merge in the rehearsal on the candidate (publication-gates.mjs dry, native-release-prepare.yml gates-dry); only the draft-bound evidence stays release-only."
